Hi,
Philip's answer covers it all and should fix the problems.

As a little add on:

I like using file.path() to combine directory names and file names:
dir_recordtable      <- "C:/This/is/where/my/files/are/saved"
filename_recordtable <- "HNN_Phouchueng_NOV2017.csv"
records              <- read.csv(file.path(dir_recordtable, filename_recordtable)

You can avoid character columns being interpreted as factors when loading them:

read.csv(..., stringsAsFactors = FALSE)

Cheers,
Jürgen

